# Verifies: SPEC §2/§3 (lexical) / DECISIONS D-LEX-02 (identifiers are ASCII-only, `[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*`.
# UTF-8 is permitted only inside string literals and comment bodies)
# A non-ASCII character (e.g. an accented Latin letter) appearing outside a comment or string is
# not accepted as the start of an identifier, and matches no other token rule, so it becomes E0005 (unknown character/token).

